ry 2020, it was released worldwide on March 6, 2020. The game is the first remake of a Pokémon spin-off game. The game features a new painterly-like art style and includes new additions not seen in the originals such as Mega Evolution, autosave, and auto-mode. As of December 31, 2022, the game has sold 1.99 million copies.","title":"Pokémon Mystery Dungeon: Rescue Team DX","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pok%C3%A9mon_Mystery_Dungeon%3A_Rescue_Team_DX","asOf":"2026-11-21"}}},"reky-switch":{"id":"reky-switch","developers":["beyondthosehills"],"opencriticId":"9885"},"return-one-way-trip-switch":{"id":"return-one-way-trip-switch","developers":["Red Ego Games"],"series":["Re:Turn"],"opencriticId":"10137"},"ring-fit-adventure-switch":{"id":"ring-fit-adventure-switch","developers":[],"opencriticId":"8433","wikipedia":{"en":{"text":"Ring Fit Adventure is an exercising role-playing video game developed and published by Nintendo for the Nintendo Switch. The game comes with two physical components: the Ring-Con, a Pilates ring that the user holds and which one Joy-Con slots into, and a Leg Strap, a piece of fabric affixed to the user's leg that holds the other Joy-Con.","title":"Ring Fit Adventure","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ring_Fit_Adventure","asOf":"2026-11-21"},"ar":{"text":"رينغ فت أدفنشر هي لعبة تمارين تقمص الأدوار تم تطويرها ونشرها بواسطة نينتندو من أجل نينتندو سويتش. تأتي اللعبة مع مكونين ماديين: رينغ-كون، حلقة بيلايتز التي يحملها المستخدم وفتحات جوي-كون واحدة، وحزام الساق، قطعة من القماش مثبتة على ساق المستخدم التي تحمل جوي-كون الآخر.","title":"رينغ فت أدفنشر","url":"https://ar.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D8%B1%D9%8A%D9%86%D8%BA_%D9%81%D8%AA_%D8%A3%D8%AF%D9%81%D9%86%D8%B4%D8%B1","asOf":"2026-11-21"}}},"rock-of-ages-2-bigger-and-boulder-switch":{"id":"rock-of-ages-2-bigger-and-boulder-switch","developers":["ACE Team"],"opencriticId":"4772"},"rollercoaster-tycoon-adventures-deluxe-switch":{"id":"rollercoaster-tycoon-adventures-deluxe-switch","developers":[]},"sca